// Example URL-loaded customization: legacyWorkList
//
// Mounts the pre-3.13 study list (`LegacyWorkList`) at `/` in place of the
// ui-next `WorkList`. The route reads `workList.variant` one time, when
// `createRoutes` builds the route table, so this file applies in the `global`
// phase. The `global` phase runs before the application renders, and therefore
// before `createRoutes` reads the value.
//
// Load it with `?customization=worklist/legacyWorkList`, or add
// `worklist/legacyWorkList` to `appConfig.customizationService.requires`.
//
// The `?customization=` parameter is off unless the app config sets
// `customizationUrlPrefixes`. The configs `dev.js`, `e2e.js`, `netlify.js` and
// `customization.js` set that property. The default config does not set that
// property.
//
// DEPRECATED: `LegacyWorkList` and the value `'legacy'` are deprecated. A future
// release removes the component and the `workList.variant` customization id.
// Use this file only to compare the two study lists, or as a short-term opt-out.
//
// The legacy list does not carry the 3.14 study-list features. The legacy list
// also expects the server-paged `DataSourceWrapper` of 3.13. The 3.14
// `DataSourceWrapper` does one query and pages on the client, so the page
// controls and the sort control of the legacy list can behave incorrectly on a
// large result set.
{
  "global": {
    // `$set` replaces the default value `'default'`.
    "workList.variant": { "$set": "legacy" }
  }
}
